# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LumenGP environment configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# This project intentionally requires NO environment variables.
#
# LumenGP is a fully client-side build. The only external endpoint it talks to
# is the public Solana Devnet JSON-RPC URL, which is defined in source code
# (src/solana/SolanaProvider.tsx and src/network/network.ts) rather than being
# injected at build time.
#
# Security note: Vite exposes every variable prefixed with `VITE_` to the
# browser bundle, which means those values are compiled into the public
# JavaScript and readable by any visitor. Never place API keys, access tokens,
# private keys, or seed phrases in a `VITE_*` variable. Anything that must stay
# secret has to live on a server, and this prototype has no server.
#
# If a build-time variable is ever introduced, declare its name here with a
# harmless placeholder and keep the real value in a local, untracked .env file:
#
# VITE_EXAMPLE_PUBLIC_ENDPOINT="https://example.invalid"
